            "en": "Genuine universality is in no way to be confused with the international standardization of techniques and consumption. It is spiritual communion amid the diversity of singular vocations. The spirit does not unfold in the abstract, but in living incarnation within a fraternal community. [Reconstructive Section 102: The pathways of testimony and ontological restoration]."
